WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.613
Here is how to install Frog Bot on Windows. It takes about two minutes, and you do not need any technical skills.

00:00:09.013 --> 00:00:17.837
Open your browser and go to sayeemkabir dot github dot io slash frogbot. Click the green Download for Windows button.

00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:32.464
Open the file you downloaded. If Windows says it protected your PC, that is normal for new apps. Click More info, then Run anyway. Frog Bot installs and opens by itself.

00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:43.972
Frog Bot opens on the sign up screen. Enter your name, your email, and a password of at least six characters. Your team is private to your account.

00:00:44.372 --> 00:00:53.755
On the welcome screen, paste your Claude or OpenAI API key and click Start. Your key stays encrypted on your own computer.

00:00:54.155 --> 00:01:01.198
If you like, open Integrations at the bottom left to connect apps like Slack, Notion or GitHub.

00:01:01.598 --> 00:01:08.716
That is it. Chat with Frog like you would with a teammate, and add more agents with the plus button.

00:01:09.116 --> 00:01:21.669
One last thing. Closing the window keeps Frog Bot running in the tray, so your agents can keep working. To close it fully, right click the frog in the tray and choose Quit.
